        ],
        "name": "DogeDesigner",
        "text": "ELON MUSK: “It's going to be pretty wild that you can have a rocket car. The car has attitude control thrusters and main thrusters in the rear, so it can basically fly like a rocket. It could do rolls. It could do crazy gymnastics. Whatever you want, really.\n\nThis is not necessarily a safety-optimized car, but it takes the fun meter to 11 out of 10.\nThis will be an actual car that’s on the roads. I’m not sure it’s necessarily legal in all jurisdictions.\n\nThe car can recharge its air tank, so it’s not like you need special propellant or anything like that. It literally is just going to pop itself up and be able to do these maneuvers whenever you’d like.”",
