      "text": "Roadster is a true pilot's car: active aerodynamics, a multi-mode suction system & cold-gas thrusters\n\nExterior\n– Concealed headlights, full-length taillight & flush-mounted surfaces for a minimalist, highly technical form\n\n– Super light wheels w/ thin spokes that reinforce structural strength when earthbound\n\n– Ano White paint brings an aerospace-derived finish w/ UV & cryogenic protection, electrostatic dissipation & corrosion resistance\n\n– Gold Glazed tinted glass mimicking the copper coating of spacesuit visors, w/ subtle titanium accents",
